{"id":"n16218-1-7","stage":2,"title":"상당히 · 颇","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16218-1-7-1","ko":"지영이가 축구를 상당히 잘하네?","zh":"智英的足球技术相当不错啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지영이가","meaning":"智英","explanation":"지영：智英；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지영이가","audio":"/audio/54469c93e7db862d00d4.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"축구를","meaning":"足球","explanation":"축구：足球；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"축구","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36700","senseId":"1","lemma":"축구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상당히","meaning":"颇，非常","explanation":"상당히：颇，非常","readings":[{"term":"상당히","audio":"/audio/82c600e3fbe3afbdd6c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16218","senseId":"1","lemma":"상당히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘하네?","meaning":"善于，擅长","explanation":"잘하다：善于，擅长；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"3","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c21dee4a35ad739c","term":"축구","zh":"足球","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3","entryId":"36700","definition":"由11人组成一队，主要用脚或头把球打入对方球门的比赛，进球多的一方获胜。","pronunciation":["축꾸"]},{"id":"82c600e3fbe3afbd","term":"상당히","zh":"颇，非常","audio":"/audio/82c600e3fbe3afbdd6c1.mp3","entryId":"16218","definition":"水平或实力、 程度相当高地。","pronunciation":["상당히"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"善于，擅长","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"熟练且手艺好。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3e30fabe10d6446a6493.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16218-1-7-2","ko":"그렇죠? 반 아이들 중에 가장 잘해요.","zh":"对吧？在班上的孩子里她是最厉害的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇죠?","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반","meaning":"班，班级","explanation":"반：班，班级","readings":[{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57301","senseId":"2","lemma":"반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아이들","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"중에","meaning":"当中","explanation":"중：当中；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"1","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가장","meaning":"最","explanation":"가장：最","readings":[{"term":"가장","audio":"/audio/8fd32c9572450a80df7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26795","senseId":"1","lemma":"가장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘해요.","meaning":"善于，擅长","explanation":"잘하다：善于，擅长；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"3","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"9f12e26e8d4c016a","term":"반","zh":"班，班级","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3","entryId":"57301","definition":"学校里把一个年级以教室为单位划分的团体。","pronunciation":["반"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"当中","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"多个中。","pronunciation":["중"]},{"id":"8fd32c9572450a80","term":"가장","zh":"最","audio":"/audio/8fd32c9572450a80df7d.mp3","entryId":"26795","definitio